msgid "Runs build, stage, comment and watch once per push, re-entering from Task_Iterate on every later revision rather than only the first. GW_Merged sits downstream of Task_Approve in the Reviewer's lane, so it is checking whether that approval actually resulted in a merge rather than deciding whether to approve one, and a \"No\" ends the pipeline quietly instead of looping back into review."
